/* Session files. Not translated yet -- and see the note at the top of this
 * section: the Arabic here must come from the ux-araby pass plus a Gemini
 * review, not from an agent. Two of these need particular care when it is
 * written. ERR_SESSION_NEEDS_CONSENT must not flatten "everything except X"
 * into a single item: what is held back is a whole process TREE that keeps
 * growing, which design 4.1.1 calls out as exactly the relationship a careless
 * translation of "except" destroys. And WARN_SESSION_MOVED carries two paths
